:: EV_a3_swapback_reminder_a
The Redmi buzzes. Kavya: //Temple. 5:30   twelve hours on the nose. Don't be late; any later and I can't get back into the hostel clean. I want my hands back and you want yours.//

You look at Kavya's hands. The silver ring. The short shaped nails. Twelve hours of borrowed dexterity, and a small, stupid flicker of something like loss.

<<hubreturn>>


